        "reason": "the agent gave the unit up: All 8 sites in util/env_posix.cc transfer ownership across the public Env API: NewSequentialFile/NewRandomAccessFile/NewWritableFile/NewAppendableFile/LockFile/NewLogger must store a new object into their T** out-parameter, and UnlockFile must delete the FileLock* the caller hands back (and deliberately keeps it on its error path). Converting them would require changing the public include/leveldb/env.h interface used by every Env implementation and caller; wrapping them as make_unique(...).release() would only be cosmetic. Left raw on purpose."
      },
