        "reason": "the agent gave the unit up: Both sites in db/snapshot.h belong to SnapshotList, an intrusive circular doubly-linked list whose tail links back to the inline head_ node (not expressible with unique_ptr). SnapshotList::New() hands the snapshot to callers through the public DB::GetSnapshot() (returns const Snapshot*) and Delete() is reached through the public DB::ReleaseSnapshot(const Snapshot*), as the comment in Delete() notes. A real conversion would need a different list structure and a public API change; make_unique(...).release() wrapping would only be cosmetic. Left raw on purpose."
      },
      {
        "id": "U-0022",
        "status": "failed",
